  "title": "John Lennon's Monkey Bike is auctioned for £56,000",
  "date": "2018-03-04",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>’s Honda Monkey Bike motorcycle has sold for £56,250. <span id=\"more-44359\"></span></p><p>The 1969 Honda Z50A Monkey Bike was auctioned at the National Motorcycle Museum in Solihull, England, by H&amp;H Classics.</p><p>It was the highest price paid at auction for this type of motorbike, and far exceeded the estimated £20,000-40,000. With the buyers’ premium of 12.5%, the total cost was lifted to £63,281.</p><p>Lennon used the motorbike on his Tittenhurst Park estate, at which he lived between 1969 and 1971. He was photographed on the bike with his eldest son Julian.</p><p><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDYwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"44360\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/03/04/john-lennon-monkey-bike-auction-56000/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1080,810\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John and Julian Lennon on a Honda Monkey Bike, 1971\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-960x720.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-960x720.jpg\" alt=\"John and Julian Lennon on a Honda Monkey Bike, 1971\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-44360\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-960x720.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-580x435.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-200x150.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/1971-john-julian-lennon-monkey-bike_01.jpg 1080w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></p><blockquote><div>Registration No:XUC 91H<br>\nFrame No:Z50A-147116<br>\nEngine No:Z50AE-146584<br>\nCC:49<p></p><ul><li>Used and enjoyed by John Lennon around his Tittenhurst Park estate</li><li>Current family ownership since June 1971 (Lennon migrated to New York in August that year)</li><li>Extensive history file including green log book, old MOTs, Honda dating letter etc</li><li>In running order with ‘matching’ frame and engine numbers</li><li>Largely unrestored and original</li><li>Huge investment potential</li></ul></div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">H&amp;H Classics auction listing</div><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/03/04/john-lennon-monkey-bike-auction-56000/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-44359 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_01-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon's Honda Monkey Bike\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_01-580x383.jpg 5