wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2000,1125\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon&amp;#8217;s Honda Monkey Bike\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_03-960x540.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTEzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDExMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-200x113.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon's Honda Monkey Bike\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-200x113.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-580x326.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-960x540.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04.jpg 2000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"44364\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2000,1125\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon&amp;#8217;s Honda Monkey Bike\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_04-960x540.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The seller, John Harington, had owned the Honda for 47 years since June 1971, the month before Lennon left England for America.</p><p>Harington acquired the bike from Henry Graham of Hook, Hampshire, who had bought it from Lennon while the former Beatle was living at Tittenhurst.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/03/04/john-lennon-monkey-bike-auction-56000/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-44359 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTUwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05-200x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon's Honda Monkey Bike\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05-200x150.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05-580x435.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05.jpg 800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"44365\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-honda-monkey-bike_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,600\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon&amp;#8217;s Honda Monkey Bike\" d